window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><i>I chose to become a Bellanti…but no one walks away from the Bruno family.</i></p> <p>My life was planned for me, down to the smallest detail.<br> I was to be a gift for a man loyal to my uncle, a pretty little prize.<br> When I ran away, I did it for love.</p> <p>I should have known my uncle would never allow it.</p> <p>They say all’s fair in love and war, but sometimes they’re the same thing.</p> <p>And nothing about this is fair.</p> <p>I should be a happy newlywed, burning dinner and stealing kisses.<br> Instead, I’m a pawn for powerful men to fight over.<br> But they’ve underestimated my husband.</p> <p>He’ll do anything to protect the woman he gave his name to.<br> Despite the Bruno blood that still flows through my veins.<br> Even if it means going against his own brothers.</p> <p>I vowed ‘til death do us part…and Marco Bellanti will be the death of me.</p> <p><b>Book three of three in the all-new angsty, sizzling Bellanti Brothers series.</b></p>"; 
